            <guid>https://brianstoker.com/.plan/2026-10-18-the-shape-of-the-gate</guid>
            <pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[Contract review landed in selfactor, so every project now has its scope and verification steps checked against a charter before it ships, and the brain index merged alongside it. A lander stall that had been reported as a full queue turned out to be a failed read of an empty one, and self project start --dry-run stopped launching projects it was only meant to preview.]]></description>
